    {
        "user": "U06QAS7FPUH",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1771284232.970189",
        "client_msg_id": "a6ced03f-44e1-4fd6-a9bf-2c995828690a",
        "text": "In my opinion (also Bensu), Eve MTJ was really strong in Dark. Light need some tweaking. (Also Dark chart text needs changing for accessibility.)\nOther tweakcn themes, they are all nice and good to have as an option to give to customers.\n\nWhy eve-mtj needs tweaking:|\n• it is very border heavy rather than contrast on background and card colour. (making 30% transparent improved a lot) \n• Chart colours are not in same pastel level (whatever it is called) with primary colour. It makes it too alone by itself in dashboard. Create new trade button itching eyes. \n• All other themes have primary colour also in chart-2 colour but this theme has it on chart-4. making primary chart-2 improved the theme significantly.\n<@U05JJ8QHBHB> I added eve-mtj-modified with some colour changes per above. I am still not sure about background colours, maybe I like more cleaner whiter look on bg colours. Like Dark Matter, Midnight Bloom and Northern Lights.\n\nMy favourite themes that could be a default theme of an app:\n• Dark Matter - strong on light mode not so in dark mode.\n• Twitter - strong on both but can use less radius. \n• Northern Lights - strong on both. \n• Retro is superb but just not our vibe. ",
        "team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
        "user_team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
        "source_team": "T0197SMV2MQ",
        "user_profile": {
            "avatar_hash": "e6c03bfa2940",
            "image_72": "https:\/\/avatars.slack-edge.com\/2024-03-17\/6814162374787_e6c03bfa29409aabbabf_72.jpg",
            "first_name": "Enes",
            "real_name": "Enes Zorlu",
